WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.900
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.250
Here it comes!

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.180
Shinsuke.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.200
Tenma.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.020
I heard from Aoi about you becoming a goalkeeper?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.130
I don't know if I have what it takes to be Raimon's goalkeeper.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.200
You do!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.490
Sangoku-senpai said so too, remember?

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:27.410
Yeah...

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.050
Do you not want to be the goalkeeper?

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.300
I don't know.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.520
It's not that I don't want to,

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.760
but it just feels strange when I think about having to protect the goal.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.760
But you were really awesome in the match.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.730
I felt secure leaving you to the goal.

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.570
To tell the truth, I was really scared.

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.160
I didn't know what I'd do if the ball got into the goal.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.450
It made me realize how amazing Sangoku-senpai really is.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.360
Coach Endou was a goalkeeper too, right?

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:00.140
Yeah!

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.930
It was so cool when he was the captain of Inazuma Japan.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:05.620
Yeah!

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.890
Then how about aiming to be as good as Coach Endou?

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:18.090
But he's such a far off goal...

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.230
Yeah...

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:21.970
Way too far...

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.980
Holy Road is at last reaching the final stage.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:11.270
Today, we're highlighting Seidouzan Jr. High, who has advanced through every match with massive point differences.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.280
We'll be interviewing the captain, Kurosaki-kun.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:23.820
Seidouzan Jr. High, coached by Holy Emperor Ishido Shuuji himself, is seen as one of the championship favorites.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.550
Are you feeling confident?

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.020
Of course I feel confident.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.830
But we can't let our guard down.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.110
We will continue to fight each match head-on as they come.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:37.480
I see. So you're continuously seeking an earnest fight.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.280
Yes.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:43.400
The ever-so-humble Seidouzan Jr. High. 
 We look forward to your future matches.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.830
Thank you very much, Kurosaki-kun.

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:54.460
Awaiting Seidouzan Jr. High are many strong schools such as last year's semi-finalist, Raimon Jr. High.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:54.580
What wi-

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.850
I was watching that!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.270
And so?

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:02.860
If you kept watching, you'd slip outside to go play soccer again.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.620
Party pooper.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.150
Just hang on a little longer.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.320
Say, you know about Tenma-kun, right?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:18.570
Yes!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.960
I want to play soccer.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.680
I think I'd have a good match with Tenma.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.790
I'll be able to play, right?

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.210
Fuyuka-san, did you hear anything from the doctor?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.040
All right, it's practice as soon as I'm out!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.040
Don't overexert yourself.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:35.930
I'll be fine.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:46.370
That'll be all for today's practice.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.370
Get plenty of rest and prepare for the match against Arakumo.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:50.760
Yes, sir!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.130
Good work!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.870
I'm starving!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.660
Want to go eat ramen?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.440
Sounds good!

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.830
Shinsuke, let's go home together!

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.820
Sorry, go ahead without me.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.540
Shinsuke...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.870
Leave him be.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.090
Captain.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.910
Let him think on his own.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.540
Okay.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.380
Shinsuke-kun.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.520
Do you have a moment?

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.540
Yes?

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.220
What's this?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.760
It's a practice machine made specially for goalkeepers.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.390
It can make all sorts of different shoots.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:37.270
With this, you can practice goalkeeper skills by yourself.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:38.940
Yes...

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:44.750
Actually, Coach Endou used this when he was a player at Raimon.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.030
Coach Endou?

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.740
It's rather old, but want to try it?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:50.730
Of course!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.410
I remember those times when I see you.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.520
Coming across walls and being at a loss on what to do next...

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:02.390
But everyone practiced with all their might and overcame those walls.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:04.540
Oops!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.180
We better start practice!

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:06.670
Okay!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.780
It's been a long time since I've been here.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.060
Ishido-san!

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.570
You look well.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.680
Yes, of course!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.650
The results of the exam were favorable and your discharge has been approved.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:32.370
Great! Then I'll be able to play in the next match, right?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.370
I talked to the head doctor about that.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.930
I'm sorry, but you'll have to pass on the next one.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.070
But...

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.690
Focus on your treatment.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.390
You'll definitely recover.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:48.900
I'm used to my illness and I promise I won't overexert myself.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.840
Give it up this time.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.220
No.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:59.050
Soccer is the only thing I would do everything for.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:03.920
When I'm scared and suffering, I can forget it all while on the grounds.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.900
Soccer is what has let me live out this long!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:14.260
If I can't play in the match, then I might as well be dead.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:22.580
Toramaru.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:27.130
You don't intend to let Amemiya play in the match, do you?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.830
Amemiya's talent is the real thing, as well as his feelings towards soccer.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:37.140
But I don't believe his body at this time would last through the match.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.040
It's sad, but Holy Road is out of the question for him.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:45.050
When I see Amemiya, I remember him...

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.630
That man...

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.190
He was the same.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:57.680
His feelings towards soccer, and the aggravation he felt from not being able to play soccer as much as he wanted.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:11.970
Over here!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:18.690
Shinsuke's troubles show that he's facing soccer seriously.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.310
All right, I'll practice when I get back!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:25.620
Our ball...

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.950
S-Sorry!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:29.610
Here.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.210
Thank you!

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.360
Would you like to join in?

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.210
Can I?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.410
Come join us!

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:41.370
All right, here I come!

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.780
Soccer is great.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:09:00.470
It can bring together the hearts of people who just met.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.390
That's right.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:03.890
Even if they're strangers,

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:08.630
you can quickly become friends after standing on the same grounds and chasing the ball together.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:14.090
On the other hand, you can say that soccer has that much power.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.200
Power?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.200
Yes.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:23.080
As time passes, that power forces people to face a cruel truth.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.330
What do you mean?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:29.570
There are those who can't win no matter how hard they try.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:34.340
Those people lose all hope for soccer and end up turning away from it.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.020
Understand?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:41.810
The power that connects people can also break them apart.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.420
What's your name?

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.760
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:51.010
Raimon Jr. High's Matsukaze-kun, huh?

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:51.860
Yes.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.110
Do you like soccer?

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:02.790
If you do, then just imagine...

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.650
The pain of never being able to play soccer anymore.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.530
Thank you!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.500
That's how large soccer's existence is.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:16.510
You should savor the joy of being able to play soccer.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.940
I'm looking forward to watching your plays.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.670
This really might be too much for me...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.710
Okay, just one more time.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.890
Are you Raimon's goalkeeper?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.230
You're...

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.800
So you're a goalkeeper too!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.000
Yeah.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.590
Brings back memories...

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:20.720
I practiced on that machine too, with Endou-san as my goal.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.740
You know Coach Endou?

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:24.870
Yeah.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.790
His greatness, strength, and kindness...

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.590
All of it was my goal.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.050
But he's too far for me.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:37.800
Yeah.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.130
He's far.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.590
But don't you think that's what makes it worth setting him as the goal?

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:47.030
Want to try catching my kicks?

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:48.770
Do you mind?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.890
Not at all! Please!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.310
Ready?

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.060
Yes!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.690
Those are good reflexes.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.740
But this is no use...

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.040
But you got the ball upfront.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.710
That shows that you're reacting well.

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:07.810
Try it one more time.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.660
Okay!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.240
No good!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.880
That was amazing!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.550
Your focus on the ball, reaction time, and lightness on your feet.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:25.490
You've got the qualities to be a goalkeeper!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.800
Really?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.160
Here it comes!

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:30.690
I did it!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:31.780
All right, one more!

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:32.310
Okay!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.550
Here's the next!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.340
Okay!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.000
Again!

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:43.950
Okay!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.830
Thank you.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.590
Are you starting to see it?

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:53.830
See what?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.700
Goalkeepers are different from other players.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:02.630
They have to keep everything on the field, from teammates to opponents, in their line of sight.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.050
It's a lot of work being a goalkeeper.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:09.710
Whenever we goalkeepers spring to action, it's always during a pinch.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:10.810
Yes.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:12.910
But it's fun.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:13.890
Fun?

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.350
Protecting the goal by yourself for the whole team...

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:19.310
Don't you think that's the best you can get?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:22.840
In the end, you're one-on-one against the striker!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:26.120
It's scary, but it also excites me.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:32.580
And you'll get to take on the ball packed with feelings from all the field players, both teammates and opponents.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.380
Ball packed with feelings...

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.310
I think it's a very worthwhile position.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:40.210
Yes!

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:45.110
Um, would you practice with me for a little longer?

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:45.720
Sure!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.760
Thank you!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.320
All right, that's the way!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:58.730
Morning.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.780
Morning.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.300
Not energetic.

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.140
Worried about Shinsuke?

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:05.650
Tenma!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.070
Energetic!

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.580
Tenma, will you come practice with me after school?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.380
Of course!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:18.040
I did some training yesterday! I stayed pretty late for it!

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.030
Training, by yourself?

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:21.260
Nope.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:25.880
After you guys left, someone came to teach me all sorts of things!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.130
He was a goalkeeper and a really awesome guy.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.960
Goalkeeper?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.180
Who?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.430
Who?

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.970
I wonder who...

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.570
Here it comes!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.490
Bring it!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:53.660
Looks like you've caught onto something from yesterday's training.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.300
I think so.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.050
You look really big when you're standing there.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.340
All right, one more time!

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:00.920
Sure!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.670
Here it comes!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.640
Minamisawa-senpai!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.880
You've sure improved, Nishizono.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:13.300
But it won't be enough to win your future matches.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.360
You're...

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:16.320
Why?

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.300
Surprised?

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.020
Sangoku-senpai!

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.920
It's been awhile, Sangoku.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:26.210
Minamisawa! What brings you here?

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.590
You're welcome anytime if you want to come back to Raimon!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.550
If I feel up for it later, maybe.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:35.240
I'm here to help you all out today.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.250
The opponents will only get stronger from here on out.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:42.710
Sangoku, as the goalkeeper, you need to get stronger as well.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:43.790
Minamisawa.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.880
I've brought this man with me for that purpose.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.810
Hyoudou Tsukasa.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.010
Let me assist you as well.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:57.010
Hyoudou, Minamisawa, thank you.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.060
Then let's start training now, Sangoku.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.930
Wait.

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:04.390
There's someone else I'd like you to train.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.090
Nishizono, was it?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:10.990
Show me your resolve to protect Raimon's goal!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:11.900
Okay!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.430
We'll train with penalty kicks.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:19.740
Use everything you've got to block the full shoots of Raimon's proud strikers.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:20.600
Okay!

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.380
Shinsuke-kun, you can do it.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:27.110
Bring it, Tenma!

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:28.040
Yeah!

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:32.270
Don't hold yourself back!

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.030
Okay!

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:33.880
All right, next!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.470
Here I go...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.190
Yeah!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.140
All right!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.610
How about this?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.970
Not bad.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:44.580
Yes!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.290
Here I go!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:46.870
Okay!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.450
You should take that one from the front!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.670
Shinsuke...

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:52.310
Okay!

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:52.650
Don't give in.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:53.860
Keep it coming!

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:56.530
Minamisawa.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.110
Use a hissatsu shoot.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:06.290
Sonic Shot!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:09.980
Focus more!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:14.440
Otherwise, you'll only get pushed back because of your size.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.300
Okay.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:19.100
Shinsuke, the real fight starts here!

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:23.640
Denrai Houtou!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.480
Focus!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.180
Shinsuke!

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:33.030
That just now...

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:42.530
Shoot with everything you've got!

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:43.530
All right.

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.660
I'm next.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.330
Sidewinder!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:56.780
Focus!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.060
Shinsuke...

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:04.970
All worn out.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.930
Isn't that enough for today?

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.400
Tsurugi.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.920
Tsurugi is next.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.130
Death Sword?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:20.950
Or Death Drop?

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.950
Will I be able to block Tsurugi's shoot?

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:25.820
Here it comes!

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.510
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:35.570
Avatar?!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.060
That's too much!

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.180
He can't even block a hissatsu shoot yet!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.520
There's no way I can block that!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.260
Focus, Shinsuke!

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.060
Focus on blocking it!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:51.760
Focus?

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.690
<i>You've got the qualities to be a goalkeeper!</i>

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.320
I need to focus more!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.830
Lost Angel!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.630
I'll block it!

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.270
An Avatar came out...

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:32.310
That was amazing, Shinsuke!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.480
That was awesome!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.090
Wow, that surprised me!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.690
So he had the power to bring out an Avatar.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:42.360
The training worked even better than we imagined.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.150
Yeah.

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.740
Thanks, Minamisawa.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.370
Minamisawa!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.100
Thank you!!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.310
Stop that!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.140
All right.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.590
I'll protect Raimon's goal as the keeper!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.520
Shinsuke.

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.730
Thank you!

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.570
Thanks for your help, Tachimukai-kun.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:17.700
I was surprised when you suddenly called me,

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:18.540
but I'm glad I came.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.640
It let me remember my roots.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:26.990
I remembered the times when I practiced so desperately to surpass Endou-san.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.040
I need to make sure I don't forget my feelings from back then.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.130
Hello.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.470
Tenma-kun.

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.270
Fuyuka-san, where's Taiyou?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.020
Taiyou-kun was discharged.

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:49.650
I see. I was surprised since no one else was here.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.340
You came to visit?

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:51.770
Yes.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.540
I'm sure he'd feel that's a shame.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.600
He wanted to see you too.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:01.340
If he was discharged, then that means it wasn't that big of a sickness, right?

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.630
I wonder if he's playing soccer somewhere now?

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.570
I don't think so.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.390
Taiyou-kun has been sick ever since he was little,

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:14.710
and he's forbidden from any intense exercise.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:16.290
So soccer would be...

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.520
No way...

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:26.010
Taiyou can't play soccer?

00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:57.220
There's a genius player in Arakumo said to come only once in a decade.

00:22:57.220 --> 00:22:59.750
A striker with an Avatar, and his name is...!

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:03.720
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Unleashed Avatar Of The Sun!

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:05.820
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:17.830
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:26.320
It's worth setting someone far away as your goal.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:27.130
That's all!
